  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We apply the options on the given equation and solve it using the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) ÷ and -\n\n**Given: **18 × 6 + 12 - 7 ÷ 2 = 1\n\n**After interchanging symbols:**\n\n18 × 6 + __**12 ÷ 7**__ - 2 = 1\n\n__**18 × 6**__ + 1.7 - 2 = 1\n\n__**108 + 1.7**__ - 2 = 1\n\n__**109.7 **____**- 2**__ = 1\n\n107.7 ≠ 1\n\nOption 2) + and × \n\nGiven: 18 × 6 + 12 - 7 ÷ 2 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging symbols:\n18 + 6 × 12 - __**7 ÷ 2**__ = 1\n\n18 + __**6 **____**×**____** 12**__ - 3.5 = 1\n\n__**18 **____**+ 72**__ - 3.5 = 1\n\n__**90 - 3.5**__ = 1\n\n86.5 ≠ 1\n\nOption 3) - and +\n\nGiven: 18 × 6 + 12 - 7 ÷ 2 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging symbols:\n18 × 6 - 12 + __**7 ÷ 2**__ = 1\n\n__**18 × 6**__ - 12 + 3.5 = 1\n\n__**108**__ - 12 __**+ 3.5**__ = 1\n\n111.5 - 12 = 1\n\n99.5 ≠ 1\n\nOption 4) × and ÷ \n\nGiven: 18 × 6 + 12 - 7 ÷ 2 = 1\n\nAfter interchanging symbols:\n__**18 ÷ 6**__ + 12 - 7 × 2 = 1\n\n3 + 12 - __**7 **____**×**____** 2**__ = 1\n\n__**3 + 12**__ - 14 = 1\n\n__**15 - 14**__ = 1 \n\n1 = 1\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 4)**",
